{"id":"vod_jy_82409","vodId":"82409","provider":"jy","providerName":"金鹰资源","type":2,"name":"公爵千金的家庭教师","name_cn":"公爵千金的家庭教师","date":"2025-01-01","year":"2025","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第12集","images":{"common":"https://image.jinyingimage.com/cover/2ae2f66d8c3320fb80dceb024ab9c097.jpg"},"summary":"「我还是第一次看到，有人能将浮游魔法使得如此收放自如。」「这一点也不难，只是大家都没尝试过罢了。」拥有当代社会无法衡量的超规格魔法技术，却保持谦虚态度生活的青年‧亚连，在恩师的委托下，以家庭教师的身分前去指导『用不了魔法』的公爵千金‧蒂娜。面对这名已被无数人放弃的少女，不打算死心的亚连所传授的课程是──「就我个人认为，魔法并不是人类以操控魔力的方式施放，而是向精灵借用力量罢了。」亚连的魔法课程内容颠覆了常识。在谆谆善诱后，亚连解开了封印在蒂娜身上的谜团，而这也是向世界掀起革命的师徒传说开端！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-09-21 11:00:06","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"playGroups":[{"name":"jinyingm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/QeZ3QwJa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/Xe01QPGa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/9b6gg4Vd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/1aM08RPe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/PdyR756e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/Rb4gw12a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/7axQWOBb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/7axQg5nb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/NbW2MDxa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/7axQQEnb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/PdR4o7wa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/qaQ35oMd/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T11:58:22.889Z"}